# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a learning experiment for the latest version of Qiskit noise learning"
msgstr "Bina eksperimen pembelajaran untuk versi terkini pembelajaran hingar Qiskit"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a learning experiment"
msgstr "Bina eksperimen pembelajaran"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a learning experiment {#build-a-learning-experiment}"
msgstr "Bina eksperimen pembelajaran {#build-a-learning-experiment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This tutorial demonstrates how to build a standard learning experiment from scratch, and use it to learn a model from simulated noisy data.\n"
msgstr "Tutorial ini menunjukkan cara membina eksperimen pembelajaran piawai dari awal, dan menggunakannya untuk mempelajari model daripada data hingar yang disimulasikan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define a gate set on a ring of qubits\n"
msgstr "Takrifkan set gate pada gelung qubit\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a 2-local Pauli-Lindblad model\n"
msgstr "Pilih model Pauli-Lindblad 2-setempat\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build the learning experiment\n"
msgstr "Bina eksperimen pembelajaran\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '4.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate circuits\n"
msgstr "Jana litar\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '5.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up local simulation\n"
msgstr "Sediakan simulasi setempat\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '6.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the program\n"
msgstr "Jalankan program\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '7.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Analyze the data\n"
msgstr "Analisis data\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Running on real hardware\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  The circuits below are simulated locally, so this walkthrough needs no IBM Quantum® credentials. To alternatively run it on a real device:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Berjalan pada perkakasan sebenar\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  Litar di bawah disimulasikan secara setempat, jadi panduan ini tidak memerlukan kelayakan IBM Quantum®. Untuk menjalankannya pada peranti sebenar sebagai alternatif:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '  *   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1**: replace [`FakeMarrakesh`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/fake-provider-fake-marrakesh \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") with a real backend.\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 1**: gantikan [`FakeMarrakesh`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/fake-provider-fake-marrakesh \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") dengan Backend sebenar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  *   **Step 5**: pass that backend as the executor’s mode, and drop the simulator options.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  *   **Langkah 5**: hantar Backend itu sebagai mod pelaksana, dan gugurkan pilihan simulator.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"define-a-gate-set-on-a-ring-of-qubits\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Define a gate set on a ring of qubits {#1-define-a-gate-set-on-a-ring-of-qubits}"
msgstr "1. Takrifkan set gate pada gelung qubit {#1-define-a-gate-set-on-a-ring-of-qubits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a [`QiskitGateSet`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/gate-sets-qiskit-gate-set#qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.QiskitGateSet \"qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.QiskitGateSet\") from a backend [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) and a subset of its qubits — here a twelve-qubit ring of [`FakeMarrakesh`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/fake-provider-fake-marrakesh \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") — then add one gate to it: a layer of six `CZ` gates covering that ring. By default the gate set is initialized with a preparation gate `P` and a measurement gate `M`.\n"
msgstr "Bina [`QiskitGateSet`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/gate-sets-qiskit-gate-set#qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.QiskitGateSet \"qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.QiskitGateSet\") daripada [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) Backend dan subset qubitnya — di sini gelung dua belas qubit bagi [`FakeMarrakesh`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/fake-provider-fake-marrakesh \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") — kemudian tambahkan satu gate padanya: satu lapisan enam gate `CZ` yang meliputi gelung itu. Secara lalai, set gate dimulakan dengan gate penyediaan `P` dan gate pengukuran `M`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Running on real hardware\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Berjalan pada perkakasan sebenar\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Call [`draw()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/gate-sets-gate-set#qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.GateSet.draw \"qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.GateSet.draw\") to see the gate on the device topology: the ring of qubits in the gate set, and which pairs of them the gate entangles.\n"
msgstr "Panggil [`draw()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/gate-sets-gate-set#qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.GateSet.draw \"qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.GateSet.draw\") untuk melihat gate pada topologi peranti: gelung qubit dalam set gate, dan pasangan qubit mana yang digandingkan oleh gate itu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"choose-a-2-local-pauli-lindblad-model\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Choose a 2-local Pauli-Lindblad model {#2-choose-a-2-local-pauli-lindblad-model}"
msgstr "2. Pilih model Pauli-Lindblad 2-setempat {#2-choose-a-2-local-pauli-lindblad-model}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Decide which Pauli-Lindblad generators the noise is allowed to have with a [`PauliLindbladModel`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/models-pauli-lindblad-model#qiskit_noise_learning.models.PauliLindbladModel \"qiskit_noise_learning.models.PauliLindbladModel\"). Build that generator set from the gate set’s connectivity with [`k_local()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/models-pauli-lindblad-model#qiskit_noise_learning.models.PauliLindbladModel.k_local \"qiskit_noise_learning.models.PauliLindbladModel.k_local\") — here every 2-local Pauli on connected qubit pairs of the unitary gate, and single-qubit Paulis for preparation and measurement.\n"
msgstr "Tentukan penjana Pauli-Lindblad yang dibenarkan bagi hingar dengan [`PauliLindbladModel`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/models-pauli-lindblad-model#qiskit_noise_learning.models.PauliLindbladModel \"qiskit_noise_learning.models.PauliLindbladModel\"). Bina set penjana itu daripada kesambungan set gate dengan [`k_local()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/models-pauli-lindblad-model#qiskit_noise_learning.models.PauliLindbladModel.k_local \"qiskit_noise_learning.models.PauliLindbladModel.k_local\") — di sini setiap Pauli 2-setempat pada pasangan qubit bersambung bagi gate unitari, dan Pauli qubit tunggal untuk penyediaan dan pengukuran.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Display the unknown parameter count for the noise model of each gate.\n"
msgstr "Paparkan bilangan parameter tidak diketahui bagi model hingar setiap gate.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"build-the-learning-experiment\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Build the learning experiment {#3-build-the-learning-experiment}"
msgstr "3. Bina eksperimen pembelajaran {#3-build-the-learning-experiment}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assemble an [`Experiment`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/experiment-builder-experiment#qiskit_noise_learning.experiment_builder.Experiment \"qiskit_noise_learning.experiment_builder.Experiment\") by composing builder stages. Each stage reads what earlier stages wrote, so order matters:\n"
msgstr "Himpunkan [`Experiment`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/experiment-builder-experiment#qiskit_noise_learning.experiment_builder.Experiment \"qiskit_noise_learning.experiment_builder.Experiment\") dengan menggubah peringkat pembina. Setiap peringkat membaca apa yang ditulis oleh peringkat terdahulu, maka tertib adalah penting:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Observe design matrix rank:\n"
msgstr "Perhatikan pangkat matriks reka bentuk:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"generate-circuits\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Generate circuits {#4-generate-circuits}"
msgstr "4. Jana litar {#4-generate-circuits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compile the experiment with an [`ExecutorCircuitGenerator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/circuit-generator-executor-circuit-generator#qiskit_noise_learning.circuit_generator.ExecutorCircuitGenerator \"qiskit_noise_learning.circuit_generator.ExecutorCircuitGenerator\"), generating a [`QuantumProgram`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/quantum-program-quantum-program \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") — one parameterized template circuit per fragment depth.\n"
msgstr "Kompil eksperimen dengan [`ExecutorCircuitGenerator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/circuit-generator-executor-circuit-generator#qiskit_noise_learning.circuit_generator.ExecutorCircuitGenerator \"qiskit_noise_learning.circuit_generator.ExecutorCircuitGenerator\"), menjana [`QuantumProgram`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/quantum-program-quantum-program \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") — satu litar templat berparameter bagi setiap kedalaman serpihan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Draw a template circuit to inspect.\n"
msgstr "Lukis litar templat untuk diperiksa.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/4088c7e98baeb5b56925c6c1f276159582c5f7040fbba76de438b919210bcc5f.png](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-noise-learning/4088c7e98baeb5b56925c6c1f276159582c5f7040fbba76de438b919210bcc5f.avif)\n"
msgstr "![../\\_images/4088c7e98baeb5b56925c6c1f276159582c5f7040fbba76de438b919210bcc5f.png](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-noise-learning/4088c7e98baeb5b56925c6c1f276159582c5f7040fbba76de438b919210bcc5f.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"set-up-local-simulation\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. Set up local simulation {#5-set-up-local-simulation}"
msgstr "5. Sediakan simulasi setempat {#5-set-up-local-simulation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To define the noise model for simulation, we use the generators already in the model with random rates to construct a [`PauliLindbladMap`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.PauliLindbladMap).\n"
msgstr "Untuk menakrifkan model hingar bagi simulasi, kami menggunakan penjana yang sudah ada dalam model dengan kadar rawak untuk membina [`PauliLindbladMap`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.PauliLindbladMap).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Those maps are as wide as the device, since the model is expressed in `backend`’s qubit indexing, but the simulator wants each map to be as wide as the gate it applies to, with Pauli indices running over the gate’s qubits in ascending physical order. Narrow them with [`keep_qubits()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.PauliLindbladMap#keep_qubits), which traces out everything off the ring:\n"
msgstr "Peta tersebut selebar peranti, kerana model dinyatakan dalam pengindeksan qubit `backend`, tetapi simulator mahu setiap peta selebar gate yang dikenakan padanya, dengan indeks Pauli merentasi qubit gate itu mengikut tertib fizikal menaik. Persempitkannya dengan [`keep_qubits()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.PauliLindbladMap#keep_qubits), yang menyingkirkan (trace out) segala-galanya di luar gelung:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The simulator names a layer’s noise by the box instruction the layer was built from, which [`to_instruction()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/gate-sets-qiskit-gate#qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.QiskitGate.to_instruction \"qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.QiskitGate.to_instruction\") returns for any gate in the gate set. Pair each box with its map, use the stabilizer simulation method, and set `seed_simulator` to make the simulated data reproducible:\n"
msgstr "Simulator menamakan hingar sesuatu lapisan mengikut arahan kotak yang daripadanya lapisan itu dibina, yang dikembalikan oleh [`to_instruction()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/gate-sets-qiskit-gate#qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.QiskitGate.to_instruction \"qiskit_noise_learning.gate_sets.QiskitGate.to_instruction\") bagi mana-mana gate dalam set gate. Pasangkan setiap kotak dengan petanya, gunakan kaedah simulasi penstabil, dan tetapkan `seed_simulator` untuk menjadikan data simulasi boleh dihasilkan semula:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"run-the-program\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "6. Run the program {#6-run-the-program}"
msgstr "6. Jalankan program {#6-run-the-program}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the program, then format the results with [`collect()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/circuit-generator-executor-circuit-generator#qiskit_noise_learning.circuit_generator.ExecutorCircuitGenerator.collect \"qiskit_noise_learning.circuit_generator.ExecutorCircuitGenerator.collect\"), to produce a [`Fit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/analysis-fit#qiskit_noise_learning.analysis.Fit \"qiskit_noise_learning.analysis.Fit\") — the container the analysis stages read from and write to.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan program, kemudian formatkan keputusan dengan [`collect()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/circuit-generator-executor-circuit-generator#qiskit_noise_learning.circuit_generator.ExecutorCircuitGenerator.collect \"qiskit_noise_learning.circuit_generator.ExecutorCircuitGenerator.collect\"), untuk menghasilkan [`Fit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/analysis-fit#qiskit_noise_learning.analysis.Fit \"qiskit_noise_learning.analysis.Fit\") — bekas yang dibaca dan ditulis oleh peringkat analisis.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This step is the same whether the executor is pointed at a simulator or at a real device.\n"
msgstr "Langkah ini sama sama ada pelaksana diarahkan ke simulator atau ke peranti sebenar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"analyze-the-data\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "7. Analyze the data {#7-analyze-the-data}"
msgstr "7. Analisis data {#7-analyze-the-data}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build an analysis pipeline around nonnegative least squares fitting of the model.\n"
msgstr "Bina saluran paip analisis berasaskan penyuaian kuasa dua terkecil tak negatif bagi model.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot the measured observable means against their fitted exponentials, one subplot per `CZ` pair, to see whether the decays being fitted are exponential at all.\n"
msgstr "Plotkan min observable yang diukur berbanding eksponen yang disuaikan, satu subplot bagi setiap pasangan `CZ`, untuk melihat sama ada pereputan yang disuaikan itu benar-benar eksponen.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Swap `exponential_fit` for `model_prediction` to compare the same data against the decays implied by the rates that came out of the non-negative least squares solve.\n"
msgstr "Gantikan `exponential_fit` dengan `model_prediction` untuk membandingkan data yang sama dengan pereputan yang tersirat daripada kadar yang terhasil daripada penyelesaian kuasa dua terkecil tak negatif.\n"
